 22→### Nearpoints â
 23→
 24→```vex
 25→int pt = nearpoint(1,@P);
 26→ vector col = point(1,'Cd',pt);
 27→ @Cd = col;
 28→```
 29→
 30→The voronoi example using nearpoint earlier is interesting, but notice that it does a hard edge on the borders.
