135→vector col = point(1,'Cd',pt);
136→@Cd = col;
137→
138→int pt = nearpoint(1,@P);
139→// ...
140→```
141→
142→Demonstrates finding the nearest point on a second input, retrieving its position and color, then blending the color based on distance with falloff controlled by a channel parameter.
